# Graph replay of TOWERS steps under stochastic cell rescaling
# (D450): GRAPH against LAUNCH within ten times the LAUNCH
# spread, isotropic, semi-isotropic, anisotropic and triclinic, and a
# continuation; a stale cell (MDRT_STEP_MIRROR_FAULT) fails the bound; a
# crushed cell stops the run.
# REQUIRES: cuda, towers-mma, hdf5, h5py
# RUN: rm -rf %t && mkdir %t
# RUN: %h5md_python %S/Inputs/check_step_graph_npt.py %S/Inputs/dipeptide %t mdir | FileCheck %s
# CHECK: step graph npt: ok
